## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design a minimal cross‑platform native bridge with lifecycle awareness and cleanup.

## Key Concepts

- RN native module basics, EventEmitter binding
- iOS Locale APIs and Android Locale APIs
- Threading, callback lifecycles, memory management

